WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:06.239
♪

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:06.673 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Geraldo: HEY, EVERYBODY.

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:08.375 line:78%
WELCOME BACK.

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:10.944 line:78%
STILL CELEBRATING AMERICAN

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:12.479 line:78%
FREEDOM AND OF COURSE MY 78TH

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:14.681 line:78%
BIRTHDAY.

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:16.416 line:78%
SOME DEMOCRATS AND PROGRESSIVE

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:17.150 line:78%
MEDIA ALLIES HAVE TURNED THIS

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:18.718 line:78%
FOURTH OF JULY INTO A BASH

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.186 line:78%
AMERICA FEST.

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:21.254 line:78%
CORI BUSH IS AN EXAMPLE TWEETING

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:23.289 line:78%
"WHEN THEY SAY THE

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:24.391 line:78%
FOURTH OF JULY IS ABOUT AMERICAN

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.458 line:78%
FREEDOM, REMEMBER THIS, THE

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:27.894 line:78%
FREEDOM THEY ARE REFERRING TO IS

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:29.129 line:78%
FOR WHITE PEOPLE.

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:31.965 line:78%
THIS LAND IS STOLEN, STOLEN LAND

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:35.368 line:78%
AND BLACK PEOPLE STILL AREN'T

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:38.104 line:78%
FREE."

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:39.506 line:78%
MAXINE WATERS ADDS TWEETING "THE

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.840 line:78%
DECLARATION OF INDEPENDENCE SAYS

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:42.475 line:78%
ALL MEN ARE CREATED EQUAL.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:44.010 line:78%
EQUAL TO WHAT?

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:46.613 line:78%
ONLY WHITE MEN."

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:47.013 line:78%
IT WASN'T JUST CONGRESS, MEDIA

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:50.817 line:78%
OUTLETS, AND

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:52.252 line:78%
"THE NEW YORK TIMES," ET CETERA

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:53.219 line:78%
ALSO TAKING SHOTS AT AMERICA.

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:54.020 line:78%
IT'S NOT A PERFECT COUNTRY BUT

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:56.489 line:78%
EVERY PLACE I TRAVEL, PEOPLE

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:57.924 line:78%
WANT TO COME HERE.

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:58.658 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: I UNDERSTAND THIS IS

00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:00.960 line:78%
FROM STUDENTS.

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:03.063 line:78%
IF YOU ARE IN COLLEGE, YOU HAVE

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:05.031 line:78%
THE PEER PRESSURE AND PROFESSORS

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:06.433 line:78%
THAT ARE CONSTANTLY FEEDING YOU

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:08.201 line:78%
THIS GARBAGE, RIGHT?

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:09.202 line:78%
IT'S WHEN YOU GET OUT OF

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:11.271 line:78%
COLLEGE, SUDDENLY YOU REALIZE

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:12.072 line:78%
THAT IT'S GARBAGE AND THIS IS A

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:13.440 line:78%
GREAT PLACE.

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:13.940 line:78%
I GET A PAYCHECK.

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:14.674 line:78%
I CAN SAVE MONEY.

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:17.844 line:78%
I CAN WORK.

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:18.945 line:78%
THERE'S ALL THIS OPPORTUNITY.

00:01:17.944 --> 00:01:22.882 line:78%
BUT THESE ARE POLITICIANS.

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:24.350 line:78%
THESE ARE "OUR LEADERS."

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:25.485 line:78%
AND THE BELIEF IN THE MEDIA IS

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:27.887 line:78%
THAT NO ONE WILL TAKE YOU

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:28.321 line:78%
SERIOUSLY IF YOU ARE A

00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:30.156 line:78%
PATRIOTIC.

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:32.192 line:78%
IF YOU ARE PATRIOTIC, IT'S A DOG

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:33.593 line:78%
WHISTLE FOR EXTREMISM.

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:34.427 line:78%
IT'S ACTUALLY EXCLUSIONARY TO

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:35.495 line:78%
ACTUALLY LOVE YOUR COUNTRY.

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:36.896 line:78%
IT'S FLIPPED.

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:40.200 line:78%
WHEN WE WERE YOUNGER, BEING

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:41.634 line:78%
PATRIOTIC WAS THE NORM AND

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.635 line:78%
BURNING A FLAG WAS RISKY.

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:44.471 line:78%
NOW IT'S COMPLETELY REVERSED.

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:46.005 line:78%
IF YOU WANT TO BE ACCEPTED IN

00:01:44.571 --> 00:01:48.842 line:78%
THE ENTERTAINMENT INDUSTRY, IN

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:49.542 line:78%
MEDIA, IN ACADEMIA, YOU HAVE TO

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:50.543 line:78%
TRASH THIS COUNTRY.

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:53.446 line:78%
HOWEVER, NONE OF THESE CRITICS

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:54.280 line:78%
WOULD GO ANYWHERE ELSE.

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:57.817 line:78%
THEY LOVE WHAT THEY GET.

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:58.618 line:78%
THEY LOVE ALL THE BENEFITS FROM

00:01:57.917 --> 00:02:00.787 line:78%
TRASHING THIS COUNTRY BECAUSE

00:01:58.718 --> 00:02:01.654 line:78%
THAT IS WHAT AMERICA IS.

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:05.191 line:78%
BUT THEY ARE ALL COME IN MY VIEW

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:07.894 line:78%
THEY ARE DISGUSTING.

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:12.866 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Geraldo: BE THAT AS IT MAY,

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:13.399 line:78%
IT IS VERY FASHIONABLE TO

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:15.268 line:78%
CRITICIZE AMERICA.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:16.836 line:78%
MOST DISTURBINGLY TO ME, THE

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:18.238 line:78%
AMERICAN FLAG, WHICH WAS THIS

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:18.972 line:78%
ICON OF RESPECT AND AFFECTION,

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:19.506 line:78%
AND SOMETHING THAT BROUGHT US

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:21.574 line:78%
ALL TOGETHER.

00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:24.777 line:78%
IT HAS SUDDENLY BECOME JUST

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:26.246 line:78%
ANOTHER PART OF SOME KIND OF

00:02:24.878 --> 00:02:27.113 line:78%
ICON TO THROW AROUND.

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:30.483 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Dana: REMEMBER, THEY ARE

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:32.218 line:78%
SAYING THESE THINGS AS THEY ARE

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:35.288 line:78%
SITTING MEMBERS OF CONGRESS,

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:36.256 line:78%
ELECTED TO CONGRESS, PAID BY THE

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:36.956 line:78%
UNITED STATES TAXPAYER, TAXPAYER

00:02:36.356 --> 00:02:40.426 line:78%
DOLLARS IN ORDER FOR THEM TO

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:41.227 line:78%
HAVE A SALARY, WELL, MAXINE

00:02:40.527 --> 00:02:42.462 line:78%
WATERS MIGHT BE A DIFFERENT

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:44.164 line:78%
STORY WHEN WE LOOK INTO THAT

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:45.331 line:78%
FINANCIAL SITUATION.

00:02:44.264 --> 00:02:46.666 line:78%
YOU HAVE A CHOICE OF HOW YOU

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:48.334 line:78%
WANT TO CONDUCT YOURSELF.

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:50.203 line:78%
WHEN I THINK IS HAPPENING HERE

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:51.204 line:78%
IS IT'S FASHIONABLE BUT IT ALSO

00:02:50.303 --> 00:02:53.339 line:78%
MAKES THEM MONEY.

00:02:51.304 --> 00:02:55.475 line:78%
IF YOU BASH AMERICA, IT'S GREAT

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:57.310 line:78%
FOR RETWEETS ON TWITTER.

00:02:55.575 --> 00:02:57.744 line:78%
AND THEN YOU CAN USE THAT FOR

00:02:57.410 --> 00:03:00.280 line:78%
FUND-RAISING.

00:02:57.844 --> 00:03:01.347 line:78%
THAT'S WHAT'S HAPPENING.

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:01.948 line:78%
JUST IGNORE THAT.

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:03.082 line:78%
DON'T FEED INTO THAT.

00:03:02.048 --> 00:03:03.383 line:78%
I THINK THAT WOULD BE A BETTER

00:03:03.183 --> 00:03:05.652 line:78%
THING.

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:07.153 line:78%
THE THING THAT REALLY BOTHERS ME

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:07.954 line:78%
IS THEY WILL DO THINGS LIKE THIS

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:09.822 line:78%
AND THEN THEY WILL TURN AROUND

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:11.024 line:78%
IN THE NEXT BREATH AND THEY WILL

00:03:09.923 --> 00:03:14.194 line:78%
SAY, WELL, HOW WOULD YOU DO

00:03:11.925 --> 00:03:16.262 line:78%
POLARIZE AMERICA?

00:03:14.961 --> 00:03:18.698 line:78%
AS IF IT WAS ON THE PEOPLE WHO

00:03:16.362 --> 00:03:20.533 line:78%
FEEL PATRIOTIC.

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:21.868 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Geraldo: AND JESSIE, IT'S

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:23.369 line:78%
TRUE THAT THE COUNTRY AS A PLACE

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:23.836 line:78%
WHERE THERE IS TREMENDOUS

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:25.071 line:78%
INEQUALITY.

00:03:23.937 --> 00:03:27.106 line:78%
HOWEVER OPEN, FAIR, FREE AND THE

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:29.509 line:78%
REST OF IT, AND WE ALWAYS BRAG

00:03:27.307 --> 00:03:30.210 line:78%
ON IT, YOU KNOW, I LIVE IN

00:03:29.609 --> 00:03:34.447 line:78%
CLEVELAND, ONE OF THE POOREST

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:35.114 line:78%
CITIES IN AMERICA, AND ALMOST

00:03:34.547 --> 00:03:37.217 line:78%
EVERYBODY LIVING IN THOSE

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:38.384 line:78%
HORRIBLE NEIGHBORHOODS IS BLACK.

00:03:37.317 --> 00:03:39.619 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: WHILE YOU CAN ALSO

00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:40.053 line:78%
SAY GOOD THINGS ABOUT THIS

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:41.521 line:78%
COUNTRY.

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:45.458 line:78%
IT DOESN'T HAVE TO BE PICKING

00:03:41.621 --> 00:03:53.866 line:78%
SCABS EVERY SINGLE DAY.

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:56.269 line:78%
THAT'S ALSO A GOOD ADVICE, HELLO

00:03:53.967 --> 00:03:57.704 line:78%
SHE SAYS THIS LAND WAS STOLEN.

00:03:56.369 --> 00:03:59.239 line:78%
THIS LAND WASN'T STOLEN.

00:03:58.104 --> 00:04:00.506 line:78%
WE WON THIS LAND ON THE

00:03:59.339 --> 00:04:01.674 line:78%
BATTLEFIELD AND WE BOUGHT IT.

00:04:00.607 --> 00:04:02.442 line:78%
RIGHT?

00:04:01.774 --> 00:04:03.610 line:78%
WE PURCHASED SPAIN.

00:04:02.542 --> 00:04:04.644 line:78%
I MEAN WE PURCHASED FLORIDA FROM

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:05.845 line:78%
SPAIN.

00:04:04.744 --> 00:04:07.580 line:78%
WE HAVE THE RECEIPTS.

00:04:05.945 --> 00:04:08.381 line:78%
WHAT, DO YOU WANT TO GIVE

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.650 line:78%
FLORIDA BACK TO SPAIN?

00:04:08.581 --> 00:04:11.017 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: HOW ABOUT THE

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.018 line:78%
SEMINOLES?

00:04:11.117 --> 00:04:12.352 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: WHAT ABOUT IT,

00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:14.854 line:78%
GERALDO?

00:04:13.686 --> 00:04:15.822 line:78%
WE WON THAT TERRITORY ON THE

00:04:14.954 --> 00:04:17.490 line:78%
BATTLEFIELD.

00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:17.857 line:78%
IT WAS AN UGLY BRUTAL BATTLE BUT

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.459 line:78%
WE WON IT.

00:04:17.957 --> 00:04:20.760 line:78%
WE ARE NOT JUST GOING TO GIVE

00:04:19.559 --> 00:04:22.061 line:78%
EVERYTHING BACK TO THE

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.428 line:78%
INDIGENOUS PEOPLE OF THIS

00:04:22.161 --> 00:04:23.896 line:78%
COUNTRY.

00:04:22.528 --> 00:04:25.064 line:78%
NO CIVILIZATION, WHAT, DID THE

00:04:23.997 --> 00:04:26.799 line:78%
MOORS COME INTO SPAIN AND

00:04:25.164 --> 00:04:27.500 line:78%
CONQUER THEM FOR 800 YEARS AND

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:29.836 line:78%
PEOPLE SAY OH, LET'S JUST GIVE

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.603 line:78%
IT BACK TO SPAIN?

00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:31.437 line:78%
THIS IS NOT REALITY.

00:04:30.703 --> 00:04:31.738 line:78%
THE OTHER THING SHE SAID WAS

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:34.340 line:78%
THIS.

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:36.409 line:78%
SHE SAID THAT BLACK PEOPLE ARE

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:37.076 line:78%
NOT FREE.

00:04:36.509 --> 00:04:38.645 line:78%
WHERE?

00:04:37.176 --> 00:04:39.145 line:78%
SHE REPRESENTS ST. LOUIS,

00:04:38.911 --> 00:04:42.548 line:78%
GERALDO.

00:04:39.245 --> 00:04:45.084 line:78%
THEY HAVE A BLACK POLICE CHIEF,

00:04:42.649 --> 00:04:46.252 line:78%
MAYOR, NDA IN ST. LOUIS.

00:04:45.184 --> 00:04:46.786 line:78%
AND THEY HAVE A BLACK

00:04:46.352 --> 00:04:47.387 line:78%
CONGRESSWOMAN.

00:04:46.886 --> 00:04:51.591 line:78%
SO ARE YOU SAYING THESE

00:04:47.487 --> 00:04:52.792 line:78%
BLACK LEADERS ARE TO NINE

00:04:51.691 --> 00:04:53.593 line:78%
FREEDOM TO THE BLACK PEOPLE OF

00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:53.926 line:78%
ST. LOUIS CLUSTER MARK THAT'S

00:04:53.693 --> 00:04:56.195 line:78%
INSANE.

00:04:54.027 --> 00:04:56.896 line:78%
SO WHAT SHE IS DOING IS SHE IS

00:04:56.296 --> 00:04:58.831 line:78%
TRAFFICKING HATRED FOR MONEY.

00:04:56.996 --> 00:05:04.671 line:78%
I LOOKED AT HER WEBSITE.

00:04:59.932 --> 00:05:05.805 line:78%
IT'S REPARATIONS, D PHONED THE

00:05:04.771 --> 00:05:10.476 line:78%
POLICE, AND TO THE PRISONS,

00:05:05.905 --> 00:05:12.011 line:78%
LEGALIZE CRACK.

00:05:10.576 --> 00:05:13.846 line:78%
I FEEL SORRY FOR HER DISTRICT

00:05:12.111 --> 00:05:14.547 line:78%
BECAUSE SHE IS NOT SERVING THE

00:05:13.946 --> 00:05:16.382 line:78%
INTERESTS OF HER DISTRICT.

00:05:14.847 --> 00:05:17.450 line:78%
IF SHE AND I WERE TO HAVE DINNER

00:05:16.482 --> 00:05:18.051 line:78%
TOGETHER, I THINK SHE WOULD LIKE

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:18.451 line:78%
ME.

00:05:18.151 --> 00:05:19.652 line:78%
I REALLY DO.

00:05:18.651 --> 00:05:21.754 line:78%
I THINK I COULD CONVINCE HER

00:05:19.752 --> 00:05:25.024 line:78%
THAT WE WERE GOOD FRIENDS.

00:05:21.854 --> 00:05:27.226 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: SHE IS LIKE YOUR MOM.

00:05:25.124 --> 00:05:28.428 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Katie: SEND IT TO HER

00:05:27.327 --> 00:05:29.529 line:78%
OFFICE.

00:05:29.095 --> 00:05:31.431 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Geraldo: WE HAVE

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:34.400 line:78%
VICE PRESIDENT KAMALA HARRIS,

00:05:31.531 --> 00:05:35.401 line:78%
THE FIRST WOMAN, FIRST BLACK

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.469 line:78%
WOMAN.

00:05:35.501 --> 00:05:39.339 line:78%
BARACK OBAMA, HISTORIC FIGURE.

00:05:36.569 --> 00:05:41.641 line:78%
AND YET, IT SEEMS AS IF THE

00:05:39.439 --> 00:05:43.409 line:78%
DIVISION SINCE BARACK OBAMA'S

00:05:41.741 --> 00:05:43.843 line:78%
TENURE HAS ONLY GOTTEN MORE

00:05:43.509 --> 00:05:44.677 line:78%
EGREGIOUS.

00:05:43.943 --> 00:05:46.079 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Katie: I THINK IT'S

00:05:44.777 --> 00:05:47.280 line:78%
IMPORTANT TO LOOK AT WHO IS

00:05:46.179 --> 00:05:50.049 line:78%
DOING THE DIVIDING, WHO IS

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:51.050 line:78%
STOKING THAT DIVISION.

00:05:50.149 --> 00:05:51.784 line:78%
WHEN CONGRESSWOMAN BUSH SAYS

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:53.786 line:78%
THAT BLACK PEOPLE STILL AREN'T

00:05:51.884 --> 00:05:55.121 line:78%
FREE, I THINK IT REALLY

00:05:53.886 --> 00:05:59.058 line:78%
UNDERMINES THE ACCOMPLISHMENTS

00:05:55.221 --> 00:06:00.493 line:78%
OF BLACK AMERICANS.

00:05:59.258 --> 00:06:01.194 line:78%
SUPREME COURT JUSTICE,

00:06:00.593 --> 00:06:03.062 line:78%
CLARENCE THOMAS FOR EXAMPLE.

00:06:01.294 --> 00:06:04.664 line:78%
PRESIDENT BARACK OBAMA, LARRY

00:06:03.162 --> 00:06:06.833 line:78%
ELDER, BEN CARSON, ONE OF THE

00:06:04.764 --> 00:06:07.133 line:78%
BEST SURGEONS THE WORLD HAS EVER

00:06:06.933 --> 00:06:09.001 line:78%
KNOWN.

00:06:07.233 --> 00:06:10.803 line:78%
THIS IDEA THAT THEY ARE

00:06:09.135 --> 00:06:11.537 line:78%
DOWNPLAYING ALL OF THE

00:06:10.903 --> 00:06:15.575 line:78%
ACCOMPLISHMENTS OF THESE PEOPLE

00:06:11.637 --> 00:06:18.010 line:78%
TO KEEP UP THIS DIVISIVE

00:06:15.675 --> 00:06:19.879 line:78%
NARRATIVE, GET SOME RETWEETS,

00:06:18.111 --> 00:06:20.613 line:78%
MAYBE GET SOME CARD-CARRYING

00:06:19.979 --> 00:06:20.913 line:78%
MEMBER OF THE NEW SQUAD IN THE

00:06:20.713 --> 00:06:22.582 line:78%
HOUSE.

00:06:21.481 --> 00:06:23.583 line:78%
IT REALLY DOWNPLAYS NOT JUST THE

00:06:22.682 --> 00:06:26.319 line:78%
PROGRESS THAT WE'VE MADE AS A

00:06:23.683 --> 00:06:28.287 line:78%
COUNTRY, BUT ALSO THE PROGRESS

00:06:26.419 --> 00:06:29.122 line:78%
THAT AMERICAN, BLACK AMERICANS

00:06:28.388 --> 00:06:31.124 line:78%
HAVE MADE FOR THEIR COMMUNITIES

00:06:29.222 --> 00:06:33.292 line:78%
AND FOR THEIR COUNTRY WHEN IT

00:06:31.224 --> 00:06:35.561 line:78%
COMES TO FIXING WHAT YOU SAY IS

00:06:33.393 --> 00:06:38.798 line:78%
INEQUALITY IN THESE COMMUNITIES.

00:06:35.895 --> 00:06:39.565 line:78%
I RECOMMEND PEOPLE READ "WHITE

00:06:38.898 --> 00:06:41.267 line:78%
GUILT."

00:06:39.866 --> 00:06:42.568 line:78%
IT TALKS ABOUT THESE PROBLEMS

00:06:41.367 --> 00:06:43.436 line:78%
THAT HAVE PERSISTED FOR DECADES

00:06:42.668 --> 00:06:45.405 line:78%
UNDER BLACK LEADERSHIP.

00:06:43.536 --> 00:06:46.506 line:78%
THAT IS SOMETHING I THINK PEOPLE

00:06:45.505 --> 00:06:49.442 line:78%
HAVE TO START TALKING ABOUT.

00:06:46.606 --> 00:06:51.611 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Geraldo: I ALSO THINK THAT

00:06:49.542 --> 00:06:52.645 line:78%
THE GREATEST CIVIL RIGHT IS A

00:06:51.711 --> 00:06:55.982 line:78%
JOB WITH THE POSSIBILITY FOR

00:06:52.745 --> 00:06:57.450 line:78%
PROMOTION AND OTHER BENEFITS.

00:06:56.516 --> 00:06:58.317 line:78%
I BELIEVE IN FREE ENTERPRISE

00:06:58.084 --> 00:07:00.286 line:78%
SYSTEM.

00:06:58.418 --> 00:07:03.222 line:78%
YOU KNOW, IT IS, I JUST WANT TO

00:07:00.386 --> 00:07:05.091 line:78%
QUICKLY SAY, TO YOUR POINTS, ANY

00:07:03.322 --> 00:07:08.027 line:78%
TIME I CRITICIZE ANY OF YOU, I

00:07:05.191 --> 00:07:10.430 line:78%
GET PICKED UP IN THE VARIOUS

00:07:08.127 --> 00:07:11.197 line:78%
MEDIA.

